		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7861A4838AA691E0"]
			description: ["The &6Creative Energy&r block is a power unit's heart. It never runs as a source, because energy from nothing would end the pack's power chain. A cloud core and the hyper assembly array, plus a mountain of field coils, processors and condensate. The gate's power units. One array row per block. Keep a stock in AE2 before the gate needs it."]
