		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7861A4838AA691E0"]
			description: ["The &6Creative Chest&r goes into the gate's base. Placed anywhere else it would void your logistics, so it is cancelled. A store core and the array. The gate's base. One craft, once. Do not forget to leave it in the network."]
