		{
			dependencies: ["7861A4838AA691E0"]
			description: ["The &6Creative Computation Provider&r gives the controller all the thinking the dial asks for. Outside the gate it does nothing. A computation core and the array. The gate's controller. One craft, queued after the computation line is running."]
