			dependencies: ["7F59412E666363A0"]
			description: ["The &6Creative Data Access Hatch&r is the interface's data store: every recipe the gate asks for, always available. A computation core, the array and a pile of pattern memory from the AE2 line. The gate's interface. Craft it after the provider, from the same stock of cores."]
